{
  "title": "Dua Alqamah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. \nيَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ\nYAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO\nO Allah! O Allah! O Allah! \nيَا مُجِيْبَ دَعْوَةِ الْمُضْطَرِّيْنَ\nYAA MOJEEBA DA’-WATIL MUZTARREENA\nO He Who responds to the prayer of the distressed!\nيَا كَاشِفَ كَرْبِ الْمَكْرُوْبِيْنَ \nYAA KAASHEFA KARBIL MAKROOBEENA \nO He Who relieves the agonies of the agonized!\nيَا غِيَاثَ الْمُسْتَغِيْثِيْنَ\nYAA GHEYAASAL MUSTAGHEESEENA \nO Aide of the callers for aid!\nيَا صَرِيْخَ الْمُسْتَصْرِخِيْنَ\nYAA SAREEKHAL MUSTASREKHEENA\nO Helper of those who cry for help!\nوَ يَا مَنْ هُوَ اَقْرَبُ اِلَىَّ مِنْ حَبْلِ الْوَرِيْدِ \nWA YAA MAN HOWA AQRABO ELAYYA MIN HABLIL WAREEDE \nO He Who is nearer to me than my life-vein!\nوَ يَا مَنْ يَحُوْلُ بَيْنَ الْمَرْءِ وَ قَلْبِهٖ \nWA YAA MAN YAHOOLO BAYNALMAR-E WA QALBEHI \nO He Who intervenes between man and his heart!\nوَ يَا مَنْ هُوَ بِالْمَنْظَرِ الْاَعْلٰى وَ بِالْاُفُقِ الْمُبِيْنِ \nWA YAA MAN HOWA BIL MANZARIL AA’-LAA WA BIL OFOQIL MOBEENE \nO He Who is in the Highest Position and in the Clear Horizon!\nيَا مَنْ هُوَ الرَّحْمٰنُ الرَّحِيْمُ عَلَى الْعَرْشِ اسْتَوىٰ \nWA YAA MAN HOWAR RAHMAANUR RAHEEMO A’LAL A’RSHIS-TAWAA \nO He Who is all-beneficent and all-merciful and is established on the Throne!\nوَ يَا مَنْ يَعْلَمُ خَآئِنَةَ الْاَعْيُنِ وَ مَا تُخْفِى الصُّدُوْرُ \nWA YAA MAN YA’-LAMO KHAA-ENATAL AA’-YONI WA MAA TUKHFIS SODOORO \nO He Who knows the stealthy looks and that which the breasts conceal!\nوَ يَا مَنْ لَا يَخْفٰى عَلَيْهِ خَافِيَةٌ \nWA YAA MAN LAA YAKHFAA A’LAYHE KHAAFEYATUN \nO He from Whom no secret can remain hidden!\nيَا مَنْ لَا تَشْتَبِهُ عَلَيْهِ الْاَصْوَاتُ \nYAA MAN LAA TASHTABEHO A’LAYHIL ASWAATO \nO He Whom is not confused by the many voices (that pray Him)!\nوَ يَا مَنْ لَا تُغَلِّطُهُ الْحَاجَاتُ \nWA YAA MAN LAA TOGHALLETOHUL HAAJAATO \nO He Whom is not confounded by the many requests (that are raised to Him)!\nوَ يَا مَنْ لَا يُبْرِمُهٗ اِلْحَاحُ الْمُلِحِّيْنَ \nWA YAA MAN LAA YUBREMOHU ILHAAHUL MOLEHHEENA \nO He Who is not annoyed by the insistence of those who entreat Him persistently!\nيَا مُدْرِكَ كُلِّ فَوْتٍ \nYAA MUDREKA KULLE FAWTIN \nO He Who overtakes every attempt of escape!\nوَ يَا جَامِعَ كُلِّ شَمْلٍ\nWA YAA JAAME-A’KULLE SHAMLIN \nO Reunifier of every scattering thing!\nوَ يَا بَارِءَ النُّفُوْسِ بَعْدَ الْمَوْتِ\nWA YAA BAARE-AN NOFOOSE BA’-DAL MAWTE\nO Re-originator of the souls after death!\nيَا مَنْ هُوَ كُلَّ يَوْمٍ فِىْ شَاْنٍ \nYAA MAN HOWA KULLA YAWMIN FEE SHAANIN \nO He Who is in a state every moment!\nيَا قَاضِىَ الْحَاجَاتِ\nYAA QAAZEYAL HAAJAATE\nO Grantor of requests!\nيَا مُنَفِّسَ الْكُرُبَاتِ\nYAA MONAFFESAL KOROBAATE\nO Reliever of agonies!\nيَا مُعْطِىَ السُّؤُلَاتِ\nYAA MOA’-TEYAS SO-OOLAATE \nO Conferrer of demands!\nيَا وَلِىَّ الرَّغَبَاتِ\nYAA WALIYYAR RAGHABAATE\nO Bestower of desires!\nيَا كَافِىَ الْمُهِمَّاتِ\nYAA KAAFEYAL MOHIMMAATE\nO Savior from sufferings!\nيَا مَنْ يَكْفِىْ مِنْ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ \nYAA MAN YAKFEE MIN KULLE SHAY-IN \nO He Who can save from all things\nوَلَا يَكْفِىْ مِنْهُ شَىْءٌ فِى السَّمٰوٰتِ وَ الْاَرْضِ \nWA LAA YAKFEE MINHO SHAY-UN FIS SAMAAWAATE WAL ARZE \nand nothing in the heavens or in the earth can save from Him!\nاَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nAS-ALOKA BE-HAQQE MOHAMMADIN KHAATEMIN NABIYYEENA\nI beseech You in the name of Muhammad the seal of the Prophets,\nوَ عَلِىٍّ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nWA A’LIYYIN AMEERIL MOMINEENA\nAli, the commander of the faithful,\nوَ بِحَقِّ فَاطِمَةَ بِنْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nWA BEHAQQE FAATEMATA BINTE NABIYYEKA\nFatemah the daughter of Your Prophet,\nوَ بِحَقِّ الْحَسَنِ وَ الْحُسَيْنِ\nWA BE-HAQQIL HASANE WAL HUSAINE\nal-Hasan, and al-Husain,\nفَاِنِّىْ بِهِمْ اَتَوَجَّهُ اِلَيْكَ فِىْ مَقَامِىْ هٰذَا\nFA-INNEE BEHIM ATAWAJJAHO ELAYKA FEE MAQAAMEE HAAZAA\nfor I turn my face towards You in their names at this very situation of mine,\nوَ بِهِمْ اَتَوَسَّلُ\nWA BEHIM ATA-WASSALO\nI make them my means to You, \nوَ بِهِمْ اَتَشَفَّعُ اِلَيْكَ \nWA BEHIM ATA-SHAFFA-O’ ELAYKA \nI seek their intercession for me with You,\nوَ بِحَقِّهِمْ اَسْئَلُكَ\nWA BE-HAQQEHIM ASALOKA \nI beseech You in the name of Your duty towards them,\nوَ اُقْسِمُ وَ اَعْزِمُ عَلَيْكَ\nWA UQSEMO WA AA’-ZEMO A’LAYKA\nI adjure You, and I beg You earnestly,\nوَ بِالشَّاْنِ الَّذِىْ لَهُمْ عِنْدَكَ\nWA BISH-SHAANIL LAZEE LAHUM I’NDAKA\nin the name of the status that they enjoy with You,\nوَ بِالْقَدْرِ الَّذِىْ لَهُمْ عِنْدَكَ\nWA BIL-QADRILLAZEE LAHUM I’NDAKA\nthe value that they enjoy in Your sight,\nوَ بِالَّذِىْ فَضَّلْتَهُمْ عَلَى الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWA BILLAZEE FAZZALTAHUM A’LAL A’ALAMEENA\nin the name of the thing by which You have preferred them over all the other beings,\nوَ بِاسْمِكَ الَّذِىْ جَعَلْتَهٗ عِنْدَهُمْ\nWA BISMEKALLAZEE JA-A’LTAHU I’NDAHUM\nin the name of Your Name that You have placed with them\nوَ بِهٖ خَصَصْتَهُمْ دُوْنَ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWA BEHEE KHASASTAHUM DOONAL A’ALAMEENA\nand given them exclusively other than all the other beings,\nوَ بِهٖ اَبَنْتَهُمْ وَ اَبَنْتَ فَضْلَهُمْ\nWA BEHEE ABANTAHUM WA ABANTA FAZLAHUM\nand through which You have distinguished them\nمِنْ فَضْلِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nMIN FAZLIL A’ALAMEENA \nand demonstrated their distinctive precedence over all the other beings so uniquely\nحَتّٰى فَاقَ فَضْلُهُمْ فَضْلَ الْعَالَمِيْنَ جَمِيْعًا \nHATTAA FAAQA FAZLOHUM FAZLAL A’ALAMEENA JAMEE-A’N \nthat their preference has exceeded all the distinctive features of all the other beings;\nاَسْئَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّىَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nAS-ALOKA AN TOSALLEYA A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nI beseech You (in the name of all that) to send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَ اَنْ تَكْشِفَ عَنِّىْ غَمِّىْ وَ هَمِّىْ وَ كَرْبِىْ \nWA AN TAKSHEFA A’NNEE GHAMMEE WA HAMMEE WA KARBEE \nto relieve me from my distress, grief, and agony,\nوَ تَكْفِيَنِى الْمُهِمَّ مِنْ اُمُوْرِىْ\nWA TAKFEYANIL MOHIMMA MIN OMOOREE\nto make up for me all my distressing affairs,\nوَ تَقْضِىَ عَنِّىْ دَيْنِىْ\nWA TAQZEYA A’NNEE DAYNEE\nto help me settle my debts,\nوَ تُجِيْرَنِىْ مِنَ الْفَقْرِ\nWA TOJEERANEE MENAL FAQRE \nto safeguard me against poverty,\nوَ تُجِيْرَنِىْ مِنَ الْفَاقَةِ\nWA TOJEERANEE MENAL FAAQATE\nto safeguard me against scarcity,\nوَ تُغْنِيَنِىْ عَنِ الْمَسْئَلَةِ اِلَى الْمَخْلُوْقِيْنَ \nWA TUGHNEYANEE A’NIL MAS-ALATE ELAL MAKHLOOQEENA \nto make me dispense with begging from the created beings,\nوَ تَكْفِيَنِىْ هَمَّ مَنْ اَخَافُ هَمَّهٗ\nWA TAKFEYANEE HAMMA MAN AAKHAAFO HAMMAHU\nto spare me from the distress of what I anticipate to distress me,\nوَ عُسْرَ مَنْ اَخَافُ عُسْرَهٗ\nWA U’SRA MAN AKHAAFO U’SRAHU\nthe difficulty of what I anticipate to be difficult for me,\nوَ حُزُوْنَةَ مَنْ اَخَافُ حُزُوْنَتَهٗ\nWA HOZOONATA MAN AKHAAFO HOZOONATAHU\nthe toughness of what I anticipate to be hard for me (to deal with),\nوَ شَرَّ مَنْ اَخَافُ شَرَّهٗ\nWA SHARRA MAN AKHAAFO SHARRAHU\nthe evil of what I anticipate to be evil,\nوَ مَكْرَ مَنْ اَخَافُ مَكْرَهٗ\nWA MAKRA MAN AKHAAFO MAKRAHU\nthe conspiracy of whom I anticipate to plot conspiracy (against me),\nوَ بَغْىَ مَنْ اَخْافُ بَغْيَهٗ\nWA BAGHYA MAN AKHAAFO BAGHYAHU\nthe tyranny of whom I anticipate to treat me tyrannically,\nوَ جَوْرَ مَنْ اَخْافُ جَوْرَهٗ\nWA JAWRA MAN AKHAAFO JAWRAHU\nthe injustice of whom I anticipate to be unjust to me\nوَ سُلْطَانَ مَنْ اَخْافُ سُلْطَانَهٗ\nWA SULTAANA MAN AKHAAFO SULTAANAHU\nthe domination of whom I anticipate to dominate me,\nوَ كَيْدَ مَنْ اَخْافُ كَيْدَهٗ\nWA KAYDA MAN AKHAAFO KAYDAHU \nthe trickery of whom I anticipate to trick me,\nوَ مَقْدُرَةَ مَنْ اَخْافُ مَقْدُرَتَهٗ عَلَىَّ\nWA MAQDORATA MAN AKHAAFO MAQDORATAHU A’LAYYA\nand the authority of whom I anticipate to seize me,\nوَ تَرُدَّنِىْ عَنِّىْ كَيْدَ الْكَيَدَةِ وَ مَكْرَ الْمَكَرَةِ \nWA TARUDDA A’NNEE KAYDAL KAYDATE WA MAKRAL MAKRATE \nand to ward off from me the trickeries of the deceivers and the cunning of the devious.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ مَنْ اَرَادَنِىْ فَاَرِدْهُ \nALLAAHUMMA MAN ARAADANEE FA-ARIDHO \nO Allah, stand for me against him who intends evil for me,\nوَ مَنْ كَادَنِىْ فَكِدْهُ\nWA MAN KAADANEE FAKIDHO \nintrigue against him who intends to conspire against me,\nوَ اصْرِفْ عَنِّىْ كَيْدَهٗ\nWAS RIF A’NNEE KAYDAHU \nturn away from me his trickeries, \nوَ مَكْرَهٗ وَ بَآسَهٗ وَ اَمَانِيَّهٗ\nWA MAKRAHU WA BAASAHU WA AMAANIYYAHU\ncunning, influence, and evil desires,\nوَ امْنَعْهُ عَنِّىْ كَيْفَ شِئْتَ وَ اَنّٰى شِئْتَ \nWAM-NA’-HO A’NNEE KAYFA SHEA-TA WA ANNAA SHEA-TA \nand prevent him against me in any way You choose and at any time You choose.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اشْغَلْهُ عَنِّىْ بِفَقْرٍ لَا تَجْبُرُهٗ\nALLAHUMMASH-GHALHO A’NNEE BE-FAQRIN LAA TAJBOROHU\nO Allah, (please) preoccupy him against me by means of poverty that You never cut down,\nوَ بِبَلَآءٍ لَا تَسْتُرُهٗ\nWA BE-BALAAA-IN LAA TASTOROHU\nordeals that You never recover,\nوَ بِفَاقَةٍ لَا تَسُدُّهَا\nWA BE-FAAQATIN LAA TASUDDOHAA  \nneediness that You never stop,\nوَ بِسُقْمٍ لَا تُعَافِيْهِ\nWA BE-SUQMIN LAA TOA’AFEEHE\nailment that You never heal,\nوَ ذُلٍّ لَا تُعِزُّهٗ\nWA ZULLIN LAA TO-I’ZZOHU\nhumility that You never change into dignity,\nوَ بِمَسْكَنَةٍ لَا تَجْبُرُهَا \nWA BE-MASKANATIN LAA TAJBOROHAA \nand destitution that You never cut down.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اضْرِبْ بِالذُّلِّ نَصْبَ عَيْنَيْهِ \nALLAAHUMMAZ-RIB BIZ-ZULLE NASBA A’YNAYHE \nO Allah, (please) strike him with humility in the center of his eyes,\nوَ اَدْخِلْ عَلَيْهِ الْفَقْرَ فِىْ مَنْزِلِهٖ\nWA ADKHIL A’LAYHIL FAQRA FEE MANZELEHI\ninterleave poverty to his own house,\nوَ الْعِلَّةَ وَ السُّقْمَ فِىْ بَدَنِهٖ\nWAL I’LLATA WAS SUQMA FEE BADANEHI\nplace ailment and disease in his body\nحَتّٰى تَشْغَلَهٗ عَنِّىْ بِشُغْلٍ شَاغِلٍ لَا فَرَاغَ لَهٗ\nHATTAA TASHGHALAHU A’NNEE BE-SHUGHLIN SHAAGHELIN LAA FARAAGHA LAHU\nso that You will preoccupy him with an engrossing, relentless preoccupation,\nوَ اَنْسِهٖ ذِكْرِىْ\nWA ANSEHI ZIKREE\nmake him fail to remember me\nكَمَا اَنْسَيْتَهٗ ذِكْرَكَ\nKAMAA ANSAYTAHU ZIKRAKA\nin the same was as he has failed to remember You,\nوَ خُذْ عَنِّىْ بِسَمْعِهٖ\nWA KHUZ A’NNEE BE-SAM-E’HI\ndivert from me his hearing, \nوَ بَصَرِهٖ وَ لِسَانِهٖ وَ يَدِهٖ\nWA BASAREHI WA LESAANEHI WA YADEHI\nsight, tongue, hand,\nوَ رِجْلِهٖ وَ قَلْبِهٖ وَ جَمِيْعِ جَوَارِحِهٖ\nWA RIJLEHI WA QALBEHI WA JAMEE-E’ JAWAAREHEHI\nleg, heart, and all of his organs,\nوَ اَدْخِلْ عَلَيْهِ فِىْ جَمِيْعِ ذٰلِكَ السُّقْمَ وَ لَا تَشْفِهٖ\nWA ADKHIL A’LAYHE FEE JAMEE-E’ ZAALEKAS SUQMA WA LAA TASHFEHI\nplace in him sickness in all these (organs), and do not heal him \nحَتّٰى تَجْعَلَ ذٰلِكَ لَهٗ شُغْلًا شَاغِلًا بِهٖ عَنِّىْ \nHATTAA TAJ-A’LA ZAALEKA LAHU SHUGHLAN SHAAGELAN BEHI A’NNEE \nso that all these (sicknesses) will preoccupy him relentlessly from me\nوَ عَنْ ذِكْرِىْ\nWA A’N ZIKREE\nand from mentioning me.\nوَ اكْفِنِىْ يَا كَافِىَ مَا لَا يَكْفِىْ سِوَاكَ\nWAK-FENEE YAA KAAFEYA MAA LAA YAKFEE SEWAAKA\nAnd spare me, O Savior, from all that which cannot be spared by anyone other than You,\nفَاِنَّكَ الْكَافِىْ لَا كَافِىَ سِوَاكَ\nFA-INNAKAL KAAFEE LAA KAAFEYA SEWAAKA\nfor You are verily the Savior; and there is no savior other than You,\nوَ مُفَرِّجٌ لَا مُفَرِّجَ سِوَاكَ\nWA MOFARREJUN LAA MOFARREJA SEWAAKA\nYou are verily the Reliever, and there is no reliever other than You,\nوَ مُغِيْثٌ لَا مُغِيْثَ سِوَاكَ \nWA MOGHEESUN LAA MOGHEESA SEWAAKA\nYou are verily the Succorer, and there is no succorer other than You,\nوَ جَارٌ لَا جَارَ سِوَاكَ\nWA JAARUN LAA JAARA SEWAAKA\nand You are verily the Shelterer, and there is no shelterer other than You.\nخَابَ مَنْ كَانَ جَارُهٗ سِوَاكَ وَ مُغِيْثُهٗ سِوَاكَ\nKHAABA MAN KAANA JAAROHU SEWAAKA WA MOGHEESOHU SEWAAKA\nDisappointed is he whose shelterer is other than You, whose recourse to anywhere other than You,\nوَ مَفْزَعُهٗ اِلٰى سِوَاكَ\nWA MAFZA-O’HU ELAA SEWAAKA\nwhose resort is anywhere other than You,\nوَ مَهْرَبُهٗ اِلٰى سِوَاكَ \nWA MAHRABOHU ELAA SEWAAKA  \nwhose way out is anywhere other than You,\nوَ مَلْجَاُهٗ اِلٰى غَيْرِكَ\nWA MALJA-OHU ELAA GHAYREKA \nwhose haven is anywhere other than You,\nوَ مَنْجَاهُ مِنْ مَخْلُوْقٍ غَيْرَكَ\nWA MANJAAHO MIN MAKHLOOQIN GHAYREKA\nand whose savior from any created being is anyone other than You.\nفَاَنْتَ ثِقَتِىْ وَ رَجَآئِى \nFA-ANTA SEQATEE WA RAJAAA-EE \nYou are verily my trust, my hope,\nوَ مَفْزَعِىْ وَ مَهْرَبِىْ\nWA MAFZA-E’E WA MAHRABEE\nmy resort, my way out,\nوَ مَلْجَائِىْ وَ مَنْجَاىَ\nWA MALJAA-EE WA MANJAAYA\nmy haven, and my savior.\nفَبِكَ اَستَفْتِحُ \nFA-BEKA ASTAFTEHO \nWith You do I commence\nوَ بِكَ اَسْتَنْجِحُ\nWA BEKA ASTANJEHU\nand through You do I seek success.\nوَ بِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA BE-MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nIn the name of Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nاَتَوَجَّهُ اِلَيْكَ وَ اَتَوَسَّلُ وَ اَتَشَفَّعُ \nATAWAJJAHO ELAYKA WA ATAWASSALO WA ATASHAFFA-O’ \ndo I turn my face towards You, seek means to You, and seek intercession to You.\nفَاَسْئَلُكَ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ \nFA AS-ALOKA YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO \nSo, I beseech You, O Allah! O Allah! O Allah!\nفَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ وَ لَكَ الشُّكْرُ\nFALAKAL HAMDO WA LAKASH SHUKRO\nYours is all praise and Yours is all thanks.\nوَ اِلَيْكَ الْمُشْتَكىٰ\nWA ELAYKAL MUSHTAKAA\nTo You is my complaint\nوَ اَنْتَ الْمُسْتَعَانُ \nWA ANTAL MUSTA-A’ANO\nand You are the Besought for help.\nفَاَسْئَلُكَ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ\nFA-AS-ALOKA YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO\nSo, I beseech You, O Allah! O Allah! O Allah!\nبِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nBEHAQQE MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nIn the name of Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nاَنْ تُصَلِّىَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAN TOSALLEYA A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nto send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَ اَنْ تَكْشِفَ عَنِّىْ غَمِّىْ وَ هَمِّىْ وَ كَرْبِىْ \nWA AN TAKSHEFA A’NNEE GHAMMEE WA HAMMEE WA KARBEE \nand to relieve my distress, grief, and agony\nفِىْ مَقَامِىْ هٰذَا\nFEE MAQAAMEE HAAZAA\nin this situation of mine\nكَمَا كَشَفْتَ عَنْ نَبِيِّكَ هَمَّهٗ وَ غَمَّهٗ وَ كَرْبَهٗ\nKAMAA KASHAFTA A’N NABIYYEKA HAMMAHU WA GHAMMAHU WA KARBAHU\nin the same way as You have relieved the distress, grief, and agony of Your Prophet\nوَ كَفَيْتَهٗ هَوْلَ عَدُوِّهٖ \nWA KAFAYTAHU HAWLA A’DUWWEHI\nand saved him from the horrors of his enemy.\nفَاكْشِفْ عَنِّىْ كَمَا كَشَفْتَ عَنْهُ\nFAK-SHIF A’NNEE KAMAA KASHAFTA A’NHO\nSo, (please) relieve me in the same way as You did to him,\nوَ فَرِّجْ عَنِّىْ كَمَا فَرَّجْتَ عَنْهُ\nWA FARRIJ A’NNEE KAMAA FARRAJTA A’NHO\ndispel my worries in the same way as You did to him,\nوَ اكْفِنِىْ كَمَا كَفَيْتَهٗ\nWAK FENEE KAMAA KAFAYTAHU\nsave me in the same way as You did to him,\nوَ اصْرِفْ عَنِّىْ هَوْلَ مَا اَخَافُ هَوْلَهٗ\nWAS-RIF A’NNEE HAWLA MAA AKHAAFO HAWLAHU\ndrive away from me the horror of what I anticipate to horrify me,\nوَ مَؤُنَةَ مَا اَخَافُ مَؤُنَتَهٗ\nWA MA-OONATA MAA AKHAAFO MA-OONATAHU\nthe encumbrance of what I anticipate to overburden me,\nوَ هَمَّ مَا اَخَافُ هَمَّهٗ\nWA HAMMA MAA AKHAAFO HAMMAHU\nand the distress of what I anticipate to distress me\nبِلَا مَؤُنَةٍ عَلٰى نَفْسِىْ مِنْ ذٰلِكَ\nBELAA MA-OONATIN A’LAA NAFSEE MIN ZAALEKA\nwithout making me suffer any encumbrance due to all that.\nوَاصْرِفْنِىْ بِقَضَآءِ حَوَآئِجِىْ\nWAS RIFNEE BE-QAZAA-E HAWAA-EJEE\nAnd make me leave having all my requests granted\nوَ كِفَايَةِ مَا اَهَمَّنِىْ هَمُّهٗ \nWA KEFAAYATI MAA AHAMMANEE HAMMOHU\nand having all my distresses relieved,\nمِنْ اَمْرِ اٰخِرَتِىْ وَ دُنْيَاىَ\nMIN AMRE AAKHERATEE WA DUNYAAYA\nincluding the affairs of this world and the Hereafter.\nيَا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nYAA AMEERAL MO-MINEENA\nO Commander of the Faithful!\nوَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ\nWA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nO Aba Abdillah!\nعَلَيْكُمَا مِنِّىْ سَلَامُ اللهِ اَبَدًا\nA’LAYKOMAA MINNEE SALAAMUL LAAHE ABADAM\nPeace of Allah be upon you both from me forever\nمَّا بَقِيْتُ وَ بَقِىَ اللَّيْلُ وَ النَّهَارُ\nMAA BAQEETO WA BAQEYAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO\nas long as I am existent and as long as there are day and night.\nوَ لَا جَعَلَهُ اللهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ زِيَارَتِكُمَا \nWA LAA JA-A’LAHUL LAAHO AAKHERAL A’HDE MIN ZEYAARATEKOMAA \nMay Allah not decide this time of my visit to you both to be the last.\nوَ لَا فَرَّقَ اللهُ بَيْنِىْ وَ بَيْنَكُمَا \nWA LAA FARRAQAL LAAHO BAYNEE WA BAYNAKOMAA \nMay Allah never separate me from you both.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَحْيِنِىْ حَيٰوةَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَ ذُرِّيَّتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA AHYENEE HAYAATA MOHAMMADIN WA ZURRIYYATEHI \nO Allah, (please) make me live the same lifestyle that Muhammad and his offspring lived,\nوَ اَمِتْنِىْ مَمَاتَهُمْ\nWA AMITNEE MAMAATAHUM\nmake me die on the same faith on which they died,\nوَ تَوَفَّنِىْ عَلٰى مِلَّتِهِمْ\nWA TAWAFFANEE A’LAA MILLATEHIM\nreceive my soul while I am following their religion,\nوَ احْشُرْنِىْ فِىْ زُمْرَتِهِمْ\nWAH SHURNEE FEE ZUMRATEHIM\ninclude me with their group,\nوَ لَا تُفَرِّقْ بَيْنِىْ وَ بَيْنَهُمْ\nWA LAA TOFARRIQ BAYNEE WA BAYNAHUM\nand never separate me from them\nطَرْفَةَ عَيْنٍ اَبَدًا فِىْ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْاٰخِرَةِ\nTARFATA A’YNIN ABADAN FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nnot for even a winking of any eye in this world and in the Hereafter.\nيَا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nYAA AMEERAL MOMINEENA\nO Commander of the Faithful!\nوَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ\nWA YAA ABAA A’BDILLAHE\nO Aba Abdillah!\nاَتَيْتُكُمَا زَآئِرًا\nATAYTOKOMAA ZAA-ERAN\nI have come to you both to visit you,\nوَ مُتَوَسِّلًا اِلَى اللهِ رَبِّىْ وَ رَبِّكُمَا\nWA MOTAWASSELAN ELAL LAAHE RABBEE WA RABBEKOMAA\nmaking both of you to be my means to Allah your and my Lord,\nوَ مُتَوَجِّهًا اِلَيْهِ بِكُمَا\nWA MOTAWAJJEHAN ILAYHE BEKOMAA\nturning my face to Him in your names,\nوَ مُسْتَشْفِعًا بِكُمَا اِلَى اللهِ تَعَالٰى\nWA MUSTASHFE-A’N BEKOMAA ELALLAHE TA-A’ALAA\nand seeking your intercession for me with Allah All-exalted \nفِىْ حَاجَتِىْ هٰذِهٖ\nFEE HAAJATEE HAAZEHI\nto grant me this request of mine;\nفَاشْفَعَا لِىْ\nFASH-FA’A LEE\nso, intercede for me,\nفَاِنَّ لَكُمَا عِنْدَ اللهِ الْمَقَامَ الْمَحْمُوْدَ\nFA-INNA LAKOMAA I’NDALLAAHIL MAQAAMAL MAHMOODA\nsince you both enjoy with Allah a praiseworthy position,\nوَ الْجَاهَ الْوَجِيْهَ\nWAL JAAHAL WAJEEHA\nan admissible status,\nوَ الْمَنْزِلَ الرَّفِيْعَ وَ الْوَسِيْلَةَ\nWAL MANZELAR RAFEE-A’ WAL WASEELATA\na lofty standing, and a means (of nearness to Him).\nاِنِّىْ اَنْقَلِبُ عَنْكُمَا مُنْتَظِرًا\nINNEE ANQALEBO A’NKOMAA MUNTAZERAN\nI will now leave you both,\nلِتَنَجُّزِ الْحَاجَةِ وَ قَضَآئِهَا\nLE-TANAJJOZIL HAAJATE WA QAZAAA-EHAA\nexpecting my request to be granted, settled,\nوَ نَجَاحِهَا مِنَ اللهِ بِشَفَاعَتِكُمَا لِىْ اِلَى اللهِ فِىْ ذٰلِكَ \nWA NAJAAHEHAA MENAL LAAHE BE-SHAFAA-A’TEKOMAA LEE ELAL LAAHE FEE ZAALEKA \nand made successful by Allah on account of your intercession for me with Allah in that;\nفَلَآ اَخِيْبُ وَ لَا يَكُوْنُ مُنْقَلَبِىْ مُنْقَلَبًا خَآئِبًا خَاسِرًا \nFA-LAA AKHEEBO WA LAA YAKOONO MUNQALABEE MUNQALABAN KHAA-EBAN KHAASERAN \nso, do not let me down and do not make me leave with disappointment and loss;\nبَلْ يَكُوْنُ مُنْقَلَبِىْ مُنْقَلَبًا رَاجِحًا مُفْلِحًا مُنْجِحًا مُسْتَجَابًا \nBAL YAKOONO MUNQALABEE MUNQALABAN RAAJEHAN MUFLEHAN MUSTAJAABAN \nrather, make me leave with achievement, prosperity, success, and response (of my prayers)\nبِقَضَآءِ جَمِيْعِ حَوَآئِجِىْ\nBE-QAZAA-E JAMEE-E’ HAWAA-EJEE\n\nby having all my requests granted.\nوَ تَشَفَّعَا لِىْ اِلَى اللهِ\nWA TASHAFFA-A’A LEE ELAL LAAHE\nAnd (please) intercede for me with Allah recurrently.\nانْقَلَبْتُ عَلٰى مَا شَآءَ اللهُ\nINQALABTO A’LAA MAA SHAAA ALLAAHO\nI now leave on ‘whatever is willed by Allah shall come to pass’\nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHE\nand ‘there is neither might nor power except with Allah’,\nمُفَوِّضًا اَمْرِىْ اِلَى اللهِ  \nMOFAWWEZ AN AMREE ELLAL LAAHE\nrelegating all my affairs to Allah,\nمُلْجِاً ظَهْرِىْ اِلَى اللهِ \nMULJE-AN ZAHREE ELAL LAAHE\nreferring all my power to Allah,\nمُتَوَكِّلًا عَلَى اللهِ\nMOTAWAKKELAN A’LAL LAAHE\ndepending upon Allah,\nوَ اَقُوْلُ حَسْبِىَ اللهُ وَ كَفٰى\nWA AQOOLO HASBEYAL LAAHO WA KAFAA\nand repeating, ‘Allah is only sufficient to me,’\nسَمِعَ اللهُ لِمَنْ دَعٰى\nSAME-A’L LAAHO LEMAN DA-A’A\nand ‘May Allah respond to him who prays Him.’\nلَيْسَ لِىْ وَرَآءَ اللهِ وَ وَرَآئَكُمْ \nLAYSA LEE WARAA-ALLAAHE WA WARAA-AKUM \nOther than Allah and other than you all,\nيَا سَادَتِىْ مُنْتَهٰى مَا شَآءَ رَبِّى كَانَ\nYAA SAADATEE MUNTAHAA MAA SHAA-A RABBEE KAANA\nO my masters, I have nothing to put my hope in. Only that which my Lord wills shall come to pass,\nوَ مَا لَمْ يَشَاْ لَمْ يَكُنْ\nWA MAA LAM YASHAA LAM YAKUN\nand whatever He does not will shall never be.\nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHE\nThere is neither might nor power except with Allah.\nاَسْتَوْدِعُكُمَا اللهَ\nASTAWDEO’KOMAL LAAHA\nI entrust you both with Allah.\nوَ لَا جَعَلَهُ اللهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنِّىْ اِلَيْكُمَا \nWA LAA JA-A’LAHUL LAAHO AAKHERAL A’HDE MINNEE ELAYKOMAA \nMay Allah never decide this time of my visit to you both to be the last.\nاِنْصَرَفْتُ يَا سَيِّدِىْ\nINSARAFTO YAA SAYYEDEE\nMay I now leave, O my master, \nيَا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ مَوْلَاىَ\nYAA AMEERAL MOMINEENA \nO Commander of the faithful \nوَ اَنْتَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ\nWA MAWLAAYA WA ANTA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE \nand you O Abu Abdullih, \nيَا سَيِّدِىْ وَ سَلَامِىْ عَلَيْكُمَا\nYAA SAYYEDEE WA SALAAMEE A’LAYKOMAA\nO my master. My greetings to you both \nمُتَّصِلٌ مَا اتَّصَلَ اللَّيْلُ وَ النَّهَارُ \nMUTTASELUN MAT-TASALAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO\nare as continuous as night and day. \nوَاصِلٌ ذٰلِكَ اِلَيْكُمَا غَيْرُ مَحْجُوْبٍ عَنْكُمَا سَلَامِىْ اِنْشَآءَ اللهُ \nWAASELUN ZAALEKA ELAYKOMAA GHAYRO MAHJOOBIN A’NKOMAA SALAAMEE INSHAA-AL LAAHO \nMay my greetings reach you both (all the time) and my salutation never be screened from reaching you both, Allah willing.\nوَ اَسْئَلُهٗ بِحَقِّكُمَا اَنْ يَشَآءَ ذٰلِكَ\nWA AS-ALOHU BE-HAQQEKOMAA AN YASHAA-A ZAALEKA\n\nI also beseech Him in your names to determine and do that,\nوَ يَفْعَلَ فَاِنَّهٗ حَمِيْدٌ مَجِيْدٌ ۟\nWA YAF-A’LA FA-INNAHU HAMEEDUN MAJEEDUN\nfor He is verily the owner of praise and the owner of glory.\nانْقَلَبْتُ يَا سَيِّدَىَّ عَنْكُمَا\nINQALABTO YAA SAYYEDAYYA A’NKOMAA\nI am now leaving you both, O my masters,\nتَآئِبًا حَامِدًا لِلّٰهِ شَاكِرًا رَاجِيًا لِلْاِجَابَةِ\nTAAA-EBAN HAAMEDAN LILLAAHE SHAAKERAN RAAJEYAN LIL-EJAABATE\nrepenting to and praising Allah, and thanking Him and hoping Him to respond to me;\nغَيْرَ اٰيِسٍ وَ لَا قَانِطٍ\nGHAYRA AAYESIN WA LAA QAANETIN\nI neither despair nor lose hope,\nآئِبًا عَآئِدًا رَاجِعًا اِلَى زِيَارَتِكُمَا\nAA-EBAN A’A-EDAN RAAJE-A’N ELAA ZEYAARATEKOMAA\nand I intend to come back, return, revisit you both,\nغَيْرَ رَاغِبٍ عَنْكُمَا وَ لَا مِنْ زِيَارَتِكُمَا\nGHAYRA RAAGHEBIN A’NKOMAA WA LAA MIN ZEYAARATEKOMAA\nwhile I have never desired to leave you or to abandon visiting you;\nبَلْ رَاجِعٌ عَآئِدٌ اِنْشَآءَ اللهُ\nBAL RAAJE-U’N A’AA-EDUN INSHAAA ALLAAHO\nrather, I shall return and come back, if Allah wills.\nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHE\nThere is neither might nor power except with Allah.\nيَا سَادَتِىْ رَغِبْتُ اِلَيْكُمَا\nYAA SAADATEE RAGHIBTO ELAYKOMAA\nO my masters, I do desire for both of you \nوَ اِلٰى زَيَارَتِكُمَا بَعْدَ اَنْ زَهِدَ فِيْكُمَا\nWA ELAA ZEYAARATEKOMAA BA’-DA AN ZAHEDA FEEKOMAA\nand for visiting you although the people of this world (may) abandon you both \nوَ فِىْ زِيَارَتِكُمَا اَهْلُ الدُّنْيَا\nWA FEE ZEYAARATEKOMAA AHLUD DUNYAA\nor abandon visiting you.\nفَلَا خَيَّبَنِىَ اللهُ مَا رَجَوْتُ\nFALAA KHAYYABANE-YAL LAAHO MAA RAJAWTO\nMay Allah never make me fail to attain what I have hoped \nوَ مَا اَمَّلْتُ فِىْ زِيَارَتِكُمَا\nWA MAA AMMALTO FEE ZEYAARATEKOMAA\nand desired in visiting you both.\nاِنَّهٗ قَرِيْبٌ مُجِيْبٌ.\nINNAHU QAREEBUN MOJEEBUN\nVerily, He is All-nigh, All-responding.",
